# Hylda's Crown of Winter: "{3}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card for each tapped creature your opponents control" (CR 602.2, 701.21, 121.1). Bot1 has the Crown and a
# Llanowar Elves; Bot2 has a Llanowar Elves and Birds of Paradise. On turn 3 Bot1 taps Bot2's Elves with the Crown (free on its own turn), taps its own Elves for mana (not
# counted: not an opponent's creature) and pays {3} with that mana and two Moxen. Bot2's untapped Birds are not counted either, so Bot1 draws exactly one card.

